00:06:25.180 --> 00:06:29.320
This episode is a great example of what the super fan episodes are all about.

149
00:06:29.580 --> 00:06:34.420
To have these great deleted scenes and new material restored within the context of the show,

150
00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:38.640
