So they had me read Jerry's part, and it was on October 11, 2004.

589
00:26:15.510 --> 00:26:16.030
Wow.

590
00:26:16.250 --> 00:26:21.410
At 10.20 in the morning to see Allison Jones at Sunset Gower Studios.

591
00:26:22.710 --> 00:26:29.230
And I was reading the role of Jerry, and I auditioned with Marla, not with Allison.

592
00:26:29.510 --> 00:26:31.350
I remember Marla put me on camera.

593
00:26:31.550 --> 00:26:31.770
Okay.

594
00:26:31.770 --> 00:26:32.570
I remember Marla.

595
