Well, Marla interviewed me after that, and she says, do you play basketball?

596
00:26:36.590 --> 00:26:38.050
And I said, sort of.

597
00:26:38.310 --> 00:26:40.710
I'm a nanny to a little boy.

598
00:26:41.110 --> 00:26:45.330
