But if you look close, I never dribbled the ball down the court.

623
00:27:50.190 --> 00:27:50.770
Is that right?

624
00:27:50.870 --> 00:27:51.070
Nope.

625
00:27:51.350 --> 00:27:51.550
Never.

626
00:27:51.830 --> 00:27:52.110
Never.

627
00:27:52.350 --> 00:27:54.430
But you're really good at guarding Dwight.

628
00:27:54.570 --> 00:27:55.710
You held your own.

629
00:27:55.710 --> 00:27:56.750
I knew how to guard.

630
00:27:56.990 --> 00:27:58.030
I knew how to guard.

631
00:27:58.290 --> 00:28:00.170
And I knew that much I knew.

632
00:28:00.370 --> 00:28:08.030
And then when I think I found out I had booked it, and I went running to Target, and I ran,

633
00:28:08.030 --> 00:28:12.790
and I bought a basketball, and I came home, I told my husband, you need to teach me how

634
00:28:12.790 --> 00:28:14.110
