635
00:28:14.470 --> 00:28:15.570
And he was like, what?

636
00:28:15.690 --> 00:28:17.150
And I said, you don't understand.

637
00:28:17.450 --> 00:28:21.410
I just booked a show, and I need to learn how to play basketball.

638
00:28:21.630 --> 00:28:26.830
And he was like, honey, I can't teach you how to play basketball in, like, one weekend.

639
00:28:26.830 --> 00:28:28.950
And I said, try, please, anything.

640
00:28:29.850 --> 00:28:33.290
So was that your weekend, you and your husband, like, trying to play basketball?

641
00:28:33.510 --> 00:28:35.410
It was, like, cramming to try and play basketball.

642
00:28:35.930 --> 00:28:38.510
And I sucked at it so badly.

643
00:28:39.690 --> 00:28:41.590
And my husband is 6'5".

644
00:28:42.030 --> 00:28:47.190
So it was like, he really was, like, blocking and doing all this stuff.

645
00:28:47.190 --> 00:28:48.410
And he was like, try and go around me.

646
00:28:48.470 --> 00:28:49.490
And I was like, I can't.

647
00:28:49.590 --> 00:28:50.310
You're too tall.

648
00:28:50.730 --> 00:28:52.670
And so I did my beSt.

649
00:28:52.670 --> 00:28:53.510
I did my beSt.

650
00:28:53.510 --> 00:28:55.490
And I practiced all weekend long.

651
00:28:56.830 --> 00:28:57.690
Got to set.

652
00:28:57.990 --> 00:29:02.930
It was funny, because the first day on set, I had to go through these massive wardrobe

653
00:29:02.930 --> 00:29:06.670
changes, because Greg was like, no, that's too frilly.

654
00:29:06.770 --> 00:29:07.830
That's too frou-frou-y.

655
00:29:07.890 --> 00:29:09.150
We need to find something else.

656
00:29:09.170 --> 00:29:15.130
And they finally gave me the cutoff t-shirt with whatever number it was, a number 38 on it.

657
00:29:16.810 --> 00:29:17.790
Wait, what is that?

658
00:29:17.850 --> 00:29:18.770
Is that a picture of you from set?

659
